category: Games
requires: libmercator0.3_4 libwfmath1.0-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Terrain library for WorldForge client/server (development)"
ldesc: "Mercator is primarily aimed at terrain for multiplayer online games and forms
one of the WorldForge core libraries. It is intended to be used as a terrain
library on the client, while a subset of features are useful on the server."
external-source: mercator

